9	/**
10	 * Rejects a create request that would place the new owner in a household already occupied by an
11	 * existing owner — same last name and address, compared case-insensitively with whitespace collapsed
12	 * (see {@link HouseholdNormalizer}). A collision is a 409 via {@link DuplicateHouseholdException},
13	 * unless the request sets {@code sharesHousehold} true to acknowledge the shared household.
